[[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238721\">7025A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238722\">7025A14</a></p>"],[128,127,0,"<p>1. Open the bonnet lid and disconnect the electrical connection\nof the indicator and front turn signal bulb.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Left headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235977\">F10A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Right headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235988\">F11A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Turn  the bulb holder anti-clockwise and remove.</p><p>3. Extract the bulb from the bulb holder. The bulb has a bayonet\nfitting.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018837.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the bulb in the bulb holder.</p><p>Insert the bulb holder with the bulb in\nits housing and rotate it in a clockwise direction.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nbulb holder.</p><p>Check that the bulb is working.</p>"],[128,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3238722\">7025A14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238721\">7025A12</a></p>"]]